    "long_instructions": "# Refine Your Data Question\r\n\r\nIn this level, you’ll choose and refine the data question for your project.\r\n\r\nOpen `project_plan.txt` and add:\r\n\r\n- your community\r\n- the community problem\r\n- one data question your group developed\r\n\r\nComplete the data-question checklist in your Project Planning Guide. Then use AI Tutor to help strengthen any areas where you answered **No**.\r\n\r\nReview the feedback and decide which suggestions to use. Discuss your revised question with a partner, then record your final data question in `project_plan.txt`.\r\n\r\n:::details [**Not Sure Where To Start?**]\r\n\r\nTell AI Tutor which checklist criteria your question did not meet. Ask it to:\r\n\r\n- explain how your question could be stronger\r\n- suggest possible revisions\r\n- help you compare revisions without choosing your final question for you\r\n\r\n:::",
